From 0100ad59e3a091fab6425c7c9398204040e72200 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lun Dong <lundong@google.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:08:40 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [stream] Trace tied uses through passthroughs

Trace transitive uses, borrowed storage, and pre-clone passthrough
sources through variadic util.optimization_barrier and arith.select
passthroughs in ResourceUsage and ElideAsyncCopies so protective Stream
clones of constant, borrowed, or pre-passthrough resources are not
refined to constant or elided.
